Constructed rollout counterexample. Not an upstream release. Not intended for deployment.

This fixture uses SPL Stake Pool 2.0.3 state, instruction and arithmetic helpers,
and adapts the bounded DepositSol CPI/allocation sequence from its processor.
SPL Stake Pool: Copyright Solana Labs Maintainers, Apache License 2.0.
https://github.com/solana-labs/solana-program-library/tree/master/stake-pool
The resolved published source is spl-stake-pool 2.0.3 in Cargo.lock.

Changes: derived from the Step 10B fixture-stake-pool-config-candidate. Only two
instruction paths; explicit program/account/layout validation; only ungated
ten-account SOL deposits with zero referral percentage; exact typed-prefix
serialization and unchanged trailing bytes. The single behavioural addition is a
stricter maximum for newly configured SOL deposit fees (1/200). No other protocol
instruction or general-purpose Stake Pool processor is included in dispatch.
